  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760374,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Dive into the underwater world with the \"2 Games in 1 - Finding Nemo + Finding Nemo: The Continuing Adventures\" for the Nintendo Game Boy Advance! This dual-game cartridge brings together the heartwarming tale of a father's desperate search and a thrilling sequel packed with new adventures.\n\nExperience the original *Finding Nemo*, where Marlin, a timid clownfish, embarks on a perilous journey across the ocean to rescue his son, Nemo, who's been captured by a scuba diver. Navigate vibrant coral reefs, encounter quirky sea creatures, and face dangerous predators in this charming platformer.\n\nThen, continue the story with *Finding Nemo: The Continuing Adventures*. Marlin and Nemo, along with Dory, face new challenges and explore uncharted territories. This sequel expands the gameplay with fresh environments, puzzles, and exciting mini-games. \n\nBoth games feature classic GBA side-scrolling action, colorful graphics, and memorable characters from the beloved Pixar films. Perfect for fans of all ages, this cartridge offers hours of underwater fun and heartwarming storytelling."
    },
